					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I actually missed the hidden collapsible, and as it was it's good enough for me to upvote.</p> <p>Originally I saw the humor category and thought this would finally be an AWCY article that wasn't edgy or dark or depressing, but as it explained about her blood's cognitohazardous effect, and that the death wasn't an anomalous illusion, the fridge hit me.</p> <p>Seeing the picture with only bullet hole and no text just made that feeling even worse.</p> <p>Great work nico. +1</p> 
				 	]]>
